; x86-64 for Machine IR: register views and the System V contract, the
; admitted SSE2 (with optional SSE4.1 and FMA) and GPR forms with their
; semantics, two-address ties and fixed operands, and selection from generic
; Machine IR. Interpretable on any host. Semantics cite the Intel SDM, never
; assembler acceptance. See the Machine IR design in .ai/.

(library
 (name machine_target_x86_64)
 (libraries core err_trace expr fmt machine_interp machine_ir))
